        "text_Wc4Vwb": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This residential project at <strong>Stretton Hall Estate in Leicester</strong> involved transforming a large family living room into a calm, elegant space designed for both relaxation and entertaining.</p><p>Our brief was to create a <strong>timeless, sophisticated interior</strong> that felt warm and inviting while introducing architectural features that elevate the room. The design centres around a bespoke media wall, layered textures, ambient lighting and carefully selected furniture to create a balanced and harmonious living environment.</p><p>In a collaboration with Mabel and Woods, through our structured design process - concept design, 3D visualisation and sourcing - we helped the clients confidently visualise and refine their future space before any work began.</p>",
